9", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fepkBJNCkN8Q7kNvwEb2usu&_nc_oc=Adrno4aJc2uvbN2NynmN_LaLjyRnZzLOj0vr--K-pCJhN_24gBCHKsa72G8zLGQTmV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHipyFW4X0EAfbUtTGL8lYEcj1WyHV7lrESmzTrUPKDYA&oe=6A918E5B"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tiDyV3r5blcQ7kNvwECzMAQ&_nc_oc=AdoLKPMi-2u3TRYQUHopAuWwd8Docz9qkiF19GC-obEYfgYs5QY5qq6aIir3rRwAadI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFJHuSWn0FklSA5rBdTNdX9AUTeVAfdVPkS-kY9nfIk8g&oe=6A918E01"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W3172y5yRw0Q7kNvwGckqfV&_nc_oc=AdonOODenQztjmJYH29lG8RcVSdgWfZiYApUDUQ7wQt47INdLz4clZHXqhUFLfgndP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEtQbtHTimnPFVyjP3hcZQ9RhYkdPNt2LMR_gtHVgvLQQ&oe=6A9179DD"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5b_IZPf50v8Q7kNvwEiR7vM&_nc_oc=AdrZw-cxF6EgfyaOpbNzEN10mZeqm0OpazHQ6etWjzo0NK_pjmNTpk2FuXnAyMbiSFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEHQf6Zb8SF2wDQIZRGPp__xZl8eDDSiXgezhQHh0OcSQ&oe=6A917BBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U3DGPVZ3t2MQ7kNvwE72x44&_nc_oc=AdqIJj9rZLA3DPQgBX0IZISDWMgYQ_RJPGMGAgN2kLXuw1o0gqbcb7tPdiNsw7XOO4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQET4HYgZQ3WwKTOF5QHqmmYZJMLgwT3ilhZF0JciUszuw&oe=6A91702E"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DZGcKx-B4ZAQ7kNvwH0c1LC&_nc_oc=AdqrsSMvFDXEYBtcD9qXn1BZSkEs6ywsshTWTqjpSogcwVM5ouWD35m47LqMStNpBIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEYeGPZ004lnCfhTMWLfHPOxYL5jpjLY8GJLOvWtugfWQ&oe=6A91691F"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L